I quickly wash my hands.
Then I fry the meatballs in a pan.
They need to get nice and dark and crispy.
It already smells fantastic in the flat.
The potatoes are also ready now.
I pour off the hot water.
I let the potatoes cool down a little.
Afterwards, I peel them carefully.
I cut them into slices and put them in a bowl.
Now only the last step is missing.
I tap on the mobile phone and start the video again.
The chef points right at the camera.
"Afterwards, mix the cooled potatoes with the mayonnaise!"
I follow this final instruction immediately.
I put the mayonnaise over the potatoes and mix everything well.
The meatballs are also perfect in the meantime.
My real Berlin dinner is ready.
